BO_ 18 ACQUISINATOR_RAW: 8 Acquisinator
 SG_ Debug_adcRaw0_U : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] ""  Vector__XXX
 SG_ Debug_adcRaw1_U : 16|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] ""  Vector__XXX
